  "question": {
    "text": "$0.45 \\mathrm{~g}$ of acid molecular weight 90 is neutralised by $20 \\mathrm{ml}$ of $0.5 \\mathrm{~N}$ caustic potash. The basicity of acid is",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [
