  "correctValue": null,
  "solution": {
    "text": "Eq. of acid = Eq of base,\r\n$\\begin{array}{l}\r\n\\therefore \\frac{0.45}{\\mathrm{E} \\cdot \\mathrm{wt}}=\\frac{20 \\times 0.5}{1000}=\\mathrm{E} \\mathrm{wt}=45 \\\\\r\n\\text { Basicity }=\\frac{\\mathrm{M} \\cdot \\mathrm{wt}}{\\mathrm{E} \\cdot \\mathrm{wt}}=\\frac{90}{45}=2\r\n\\end{array}$",
